# Headed receipt of the update status chip (2026-07-24 auto-update plan, H3).
#
# The `--update-now` path proves the mechanism in a terminal; this proves the
# app SHOWS it. Point the app at a feed offering a newer version and the top
# bar should say so. The default `notify` policy means nothing is downloaded,
# so this scenario cannot install anything.
#
#   HOCKET_UPDATE_FEED=<feed dir> HOCKET_UPDATE_PUBKEY=<key> \
#   HOCKET_SCENARIO=scenarios/update_status.scn HOCKET_CAPTURE_DIR=<dir> \
#     <installed hocket>
#
# Must run the INSTALLED build: a dev binary honestly reports itself
# un-updatable, and the chip would say that instead.
settle 40
# "Version <x> available" — NOT a bare `available`, which also matches
# "Updates unavailable" and would pass on exactly the wrong state.
assert text Version
assert text 0.3.0
capture 01_update_available
settle 5
log update status chip captured
